        `year`                                           IS y
        `the reduced amount`                             IS 7_703
        `the maximum monthly income`                     IS 51_910
        `the minimum amount`                             IS 123
        `the old-age pension amount`                     IS 237
        `the old-age pension amount raised for a spouse` IS 340

