        `minimum income`                IS c
        `reduced rate for a benefit`    IS `decline where the readings differ`
        `old-age pensioner with income` IS `decline where the readings differ`
        `computed amount of nothing`    IS `decline where the readings differ`
        `benefit and income together`   IS `decline where the readings differ`

GIVEN c IS A `A reading of the reduced rate for a benefit`
      d IS A `A reading of a benefit and an income in one month`
