`the default readings with the benefit read as` c `and` d MEANS
    `The readings section 14 is applied under` WITH
        `income ceiling`                IS `decline where the readings differ`
        `minimum income`                IS `decline where the readings differ`
        `reduced rate for a benefit`    IS c
        `old-age pensioner with income` IS `decline where the readings differ`
        `computed amount of nothing`    IS `decline where the readings differ`
        `benefit and income together`   IS d

GIVEN c IS A `A reading of the old-age pensioner who is also paid an income`
